#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:5
msgid "How to Handle and Report Fraud – HSBC HK"
msgstr "懷疑受騙？教您處理及舉報 - 香港滙豐"

#: frontend/templates/android-malware-safety-measures.html:13
msgid "Cyber security and fraud hub"
msgstr "網路安全及防詐騙資訊中心"

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:11
msgid "How should I handle and report fraud?"
msgstr "懷疑受騙？教您處理及舉報"

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:18
msgid ""
"HSBC is committed to fighting fraud and protecting your funds and data. "
"If we notice any suspicious activity on your account, we will contact "
"you—but we will never ask for your log on credentials or passwords. If "
"you suspect fraud, report it to us immediately to help minimize the "
"impact."
msgstr "滙豐一直遵守嚴格保安措施，確保您的資金及資料安全。如果我們發現您的銀行戶口出現可疑活動，我們會與您聯絡，向您確認。然而，我們絕對不會要求您提供登入賬號及密碼等敏感個人資料"

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:21
msgid "What problem have you encountered?"
msgstr "您發現甚麼問題？"

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:23
msgid "I don’t recognise a transaction on my statement"
msgstr "賬單上有我不認得的交易賬單上有我不認得的交易"

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:24
msgid "I got an SMS alert from HSBC about a possible unauthorised transaction"
msgstr "我收到來自滙豐的短訊提示，提醒我的信用卡可能出現未經授權的交易"

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:25
msgid "I received a suspicious email claiming to be from HSBC"
msgstr "我收到可疑的滙豐電郵"

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:26
msgid "I received a suspicious phone call claiming to be from HSBC"
msgstr "我收到可疑的滙豐電話"

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:27
msgid "I can't find my credit card or it has been stolen"
msgstr "我的信用卡遺失或者被盗"

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:28
msgid "I think my log on credentials have been disclosed"
msgstr "我的登入資料被洩露"

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:32
msgid "What to do in each case"
msgstr "在每種情況下，您應如何應對？"

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:33
msgid "If you don’t recognise a transaction"
msgstr "您的月結單出現未能確認的費用，未必一定與詐騙有關，可能還有其他原因。"

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:34
msgid "Check your"
msgstr "請閱讀"

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:34
msgid "transaction dispute page"
msgstr "我們的交易支援頁面，"

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:34
msgid ""
"for possible reasons. If still unsure, contact the merchant, then HSBC if"
" unresolved. If you suspect fraud, contact HSBC immediately:"
msgstr "嘗試找出原因。如果您仍然無法確認交易，請先聯絡商戶解決問題，然後盡快與我們聯絡。若您依然無法解決問題，並懷疑遭到詐騙，請立即聯絡我們。"

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:36
msgid "HSBC Global Private Banking:"
msgstr "滙豐環球私人銀行客戶："

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:37
msgid "HSBC Premier Elite:"
msgstr "滙豐卓越理財尊尚客戶："

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:38
msgid "HSBC Premier:"
msgstr "滙豐卓越理財客戶："

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:39
msgid "All other customers:"
msgstr "其他客戶："

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:40
msgid "Email:"
msgstr "電郵："

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:42
msgid "If you get an SMS alert from HSBC"
msgstr "您收到有關短訊時，"

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:43
msgid ""
"Reply \"Y\" or \"Yes\" if you made the payment, \"N\" or \"No\" if you "
"didn’t. HSBC will never ask for personal info via SMS. If you receive a "
"suspicious SMS, do not reply or click links—report it to HSBC at"
msgstr "如交易屬實並由您本人支付，只須回覆「Y」或「Yes」確認，否則請回覆「N」或「No」。回覆我們的短訊時，請勿分享任何敏感的個人資料。"

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:44
msgid "If you receive a suspicious email"
msgstr "如果您收到的電郵，它的外觀、感覺或內容都跟以往收到的滙豐電郵不同，"

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:45
msgid "Do not reply, click links, or open attachments. Forward to"
msgstr "千萬不要回覆、點擊任何連結或開啟任何附件。您也可以將任何收到的可疑電郵轉寄到"

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:45
msgid "and call HSBC if concerned."
msgstr "如果電郵十分可疑，請即向我們舉報。"

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:46
msgid "If you receive a suspicious call"
msgstr "如果您接到自稱滙豐職員的可疑電話或任何預先錄製的語音來電，"

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:47
msgid ""
"Hang up immediately. Contact HSBC to verify. If you disclosed info, "
"change your passwords and monitor your statements. Email"
msgstr "請立即掛線，並向我們查詢或舉報。若您曾向來電者透露個人密碼等敏感資料，應立即更改相關資料，並定期查閱銀行及信用卡結單和通知書。您也可以傳送電郵至"

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:47
msgid "if needed."
msgstr "向我們回報。"

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:48
msgid "If your credit card is lost or stolen"
msgstr "如果您遺失信用卡，或者懷疑信用卡被盗竊或盗用，"

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:49
msgid "Report via the HSBC HK Mobile Banking app or"
msgstr "請通過香港滙豐流動理財應用程式"

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:49
msgid "online banking"
msgstr "或登入網上理財報失信用卡。"

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:49
msgid ""
", or call the hotline above. You can also temporarily block your card "
"online for up to 60 days."
msgstr "您也可以致電我們的24小時客戶服務熱線，報失信用卡。如果您確定信用卡没有遺失或被盗，只是一時想不起它在甚麼地方，可以登入網上理財，將信用卡暫時封鎖60日。"

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:50
msgid "If your log on credentials have been disclosed"
msgstr "如果您不慎洩露賬戶登入資料、密碼或保安編碼等敏感資料，"

#: frontend/templates/how-to-report-fraud.html:51
msgid ""
"Call HSBC immediately, check your transaction records for unauthorized "
"activity, and change your passwords."
msgstr "，請立即致電熱線向我們報告，並馬上檢查戶口交易紀錄。如發現任何未經授權的交易，請立即致電熱線向我們報告。我們在經您同意後，可以助您暫時凍結戶口，免蒙受更多損失。"

